{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh8aYN8cjTXj4exaZ5Sr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"While that runs, a short README in the dev folder for whoever builds out the rest (commands, layout, how to add content)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":693377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":624},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f","uuid":"ace0eea7-2b29-4d98-9dba-1cb8df46c225","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:53:05.056Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh8aY2XewXAunXk8RXe2"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh8aYN8cjTXj4exaZ5Sr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012GCfiXMzGmWbiTuf9ocSzy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183213__xf5fb84/work/TideCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183213/README.md","content":"# Tide Crisis 3 (dev folder)\n\nAn original arcade light-gun rail shooter on the my-3D2dge engine (v0.85.2, patched: `engine/PATCHES.md`).\n\n## Commands\n```sh\nnode tools/build.mjs                 # build/game.js, the single HTML beside this folder, and exit-interview.json\nnode tests/run.mjs                   # fast headless suites: prints only failures and one count line\nnode tests/run.mjs playthrough       # bot playthroughs: every stage on Normal, ARCADE to the credits, Training\nnode tests/run.mjs --all             # everything, plus the browser check (4 sizes) and the AI Hub harness (4 scenarios)\n```\nDev deep links on the built page: `#play=2:2-B&bot` (a scene, with the bot), `&p2` (a P2 bot in split screen),\n`&dev` (dev panel), `&god`, `#scene=menu`.\n\n## Layout\n`src/` holds the game as numbered fragments of one IIFE (each starts with what it owns): core and registries (00),\nmaterials (02), the geometry builder (03), the Rail3D renderer (04), the Sim (20), enemies (21), combat (22), bosses\n(25), the stage format and prefabs (30), the stages (31-34), story (40), voice (41), audio (42), the view (44-45),\ninput (46), HUD (50), screens (51), dev mode (52), the bot and attract (53), the session (60), AI Hub (62), main (90)\nand the About data (99).\n\n## Adding content\nEverything is data in registries: `def('scene', id, {...})` in a stage file adds an area (an arrival rail, two slots\nfrom `Frame.slots()`, cover points from `covers()`, waves, objects, cues); `def('enemy', ...)`, `def('boss', ...)`,\n`def('cutscene', ...)`, `def('song', ...)`, `def('speaker', ...)`. The content suite runs the validators: every id\nresolves, every cover point's exposed head is on screen and shootable, every objective and bonus target can be hit.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":624,"cache_read_input_tokens":693377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":624},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"14efaf47-c831-41be-b2ba-0398106a097f","uuid":"03e17ac8-7380-4faa-a936-7175170b69cc","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:53:12.144Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh8aY2XewXAunXk8RXe2","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012GCfiXMzGmWbiTuf9ocSzy":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-183213__xf5fb84/work/TideCrisis3-TimeCrisis3-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183213/README.md","content":"# Tide Crisis 3 (dev folder)\n\nAn original arcade light-gun rail shooter on the my-3D2dge engine (v0.85.2, patched: `engine/PATCHES.md`).\n\n## Commands\n```sh\nnode tools/build.mjs                 # build/game.js, the single HTML beside this folder, and exit-interview.json\nnode tests/run.mjs                   # fast headless suites: prints only failures and one count line\nnode tests/run.mjs playthrough       # bot playthroughs: every stage on Normal, ARCADE to the credits, Training\nnode tests/run.mjs --all             # everything, plus the browser check (4 sizes) and the AI Hub harness (4 scenarios)\n```\nDev deep links on the built page: `#play=2:2-B&bot` (a scene, with the bot), `&p2` (a P2 bot in split screen),\n`&dev` (dev panel), `&god`, `#scene=menu`.\n\n## Layout\n`src/` holds the game as numbered fragments of one IIFE (each starts with what it owns): core and registries (00),\nmaterials (02), the geometry builder (03), the Rail3D renderer (04), the Sim (20), enemies (21), combat (22), bosses\n(25), the stage format and prefabs (30), the stages (31-34), story (40), voice (41), audio (42), the view (44-45),\ninput (46), HUD (50), screens (51), dev mode (52), the bot and attract (53), the session (60), AI Hub (62), main (90)\nand the About data (99).\n\n## Adding content\nEverything is data in registries: `def('scene', id, {...})` in a stage file adds an area (an arrival rail, two slots\nfrom `Frame.slots()`, cover points from `covers()`, waves, objects, cues); `def('enemy', ...)`, `def('boss', ...)`,\n`def('cutscene', ...)`, `def('song', ...)`, `def('speaker', ...)`. The content suite runs the validators: every id\nresolves, every cover point's exposed head is on screen and shootable, every objective and bonus target can be hit.\n"}}}
